WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,740
Wang Zhi actually invited Elder Tang

2
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,710
Who is Elder Tang?

3
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,310
Butterfly Cui Feng Guan Shi

4
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,410
Usually only duels of level three or above are allowed

5
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:23,210
No wonder Fang Qingshan wants me to win

6
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,030
If you lose this

7
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:29,480
I have to embarrass Sister Ji in the circle of elders and feel at ease.

8
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,880
I will win no matter what

9
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,900
This is why Wang Zhi said he didn’t understand Uncle Li

10
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,000
A disrespectful and trouble-making man

11
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,690
But at the age of fifteen or sixteen, he is already at the second level

12
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:47,450
Good talent

13
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,410
How can I just be a handyman?

14
00:00:49,610 --> 00:01:04,650
Amazing

15
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:06,350
Let the duel begin

16
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:07,850
Elder Tang, please wait.

17
00:01:07,850 --> 00:01:09,550
Life and death collide
